/plaintext.zip
/enc-bundle.zip
/latest.json
/new_latest.json
/app-version.json
# One-shot codemods left behind by an earlier agent session. The fix_*/patch_*
# set was actually COMMITTED and had to be untracked; a glob so the next batch
